<title>HUNGARY: BUDAPEST BOURSE TURNOVER RISES TO HUF 8.480 BLN.</title>
<headline>BUDAPEST BOURSE TURNOVER RISES TO HUF 8.480 BLN.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Budapest Stock Exchange's spot share turnover rose to 8.480 billion forints on Wednesday from 7.927 billion forints on Tuesday, according to final figures.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsrogm +36 1 327-4040</p>
